[Collection("stdlib", "port")]
module StdlibPortTests

// Ported standard-library tests from tests/compiler.StandardLibraryTests,
// running against the current C# host compiler through the host test protocol.
// Each [Fact] wrapper below delegates to a <Name>Impl body in an imported
// companion module (one companion per C# source file). Imports and wrappers are
// auto-wired as ports land. Requires STARK_HOST_COMPILER to point at the host
// compiler executable. The original C# tests remain the oracle until cutover.


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Auto-wired [Fact] wrappers for ported C# tests (bodies in imported companions).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
